1
00:00:13,638 --> 00:00:16,850
Do not chase the bone. Leave it be.

2
00:00:16,933 --> 00:00:20,812
Let his bone wander about freely.

3
00:00:20,895 --> 00:00:24,899
Then, I will combine it
with Jotaro Kujo's memory.

4
00:00:24,983 --> 00:00:26,943
I will learn the truth!

5
00:00:27,527 --> 00:00:31,573
The bone must have gotten
implanted inside this green fruit.

6
00:00:31,656 --> 00:00:36,202
Pale Snake is at this prison
to discover what lies beyond this point.

7
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:38,413
What will it spawn?

8
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:41,833
He wants to know
what transpires when it is born.

9
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:43,918
We'll leave you to find its User

10
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:45,670
and finish him off.

11
00:00:46,921 --> 00:00:48,047
Fuck…

12
00:00:48,131 --> 00:00:50,467
Who would have thought that was an attack?

13
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:53,678
His bodily fluids… He used his spit

14
00:00:54,262 --> 00:00:57,098
to destroy my mouth before I realized it.

15
00:00:57,891 --> 00:01:00,477
He attacked me slowly, little by little.

16
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:02,896
What should I do?

17
00:01:02,979 --> 00:01:05,023
Should I go after Jolyne's boat?

18
00:01:05,106 --> 00:01:06,024
No.

19
00:01:06,816 --> 00:01:08,026
I will stick to my mission

20
00:01:08,109 --> 00:01:11,279
and go finish off that Stand's User.

21
00:01:11,863 --> 00:01:13,323
This is the most definite way.

22
00:02:46,207 --> 00:02:48,543
EPISODE 20: F.F. - THE WITNESS

23
00:02:48,626 --> 00:02:49,544
Hey you.

24
00:02:50,128 --> 00:02:51,963
Head toward that island.

25
00:03:01,514 --> 00:03:05,393
Why are we stopping at this hidden place?

26
00:03:05,476 --> 00:03:08,688
Hey, turn off the engine.
Don't make a sound.

27
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:10,773
Don't you hear that?

28
00:03:18,239 --> 00:03:21,659
I said hurry up
and turn off the engine, idiot!

29
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:28,583
Emergency in the Disciplinary Wing area.

30
00:03:28,666 --> 00:03:31,669
The entire facility
is on Level 4 security.

31
00:03:31,753 --> 00:03:33,963
Stay on high alert!

32
00:03:34,881 --> 00:03:37,800
That's a 12.7mm M2 heavy machine gun.

33
00:03:37,884 --> 00:03:40,929
Its range is 1,000 to 2,000 meters.

34
00:03:41,554 --> 00:03:44,307
A mere graze from that bullet
would blow our limbs off.

35
00:03:44,390 --> 00:03:46,434
This old boat would be shot into pieces.

36
00:03:49,979 --> 00:03:51,064
Hey, shut up.

37
00:03:51,147 --> 00:03:52,982
You're shaking the boat.

38
00:03:53,566 --> 00:03:56,277
Stay away from the steering!

39
00:04:01,032 --> 00:04:02,158
Stay calm.

40
00:04:02,242 --> 00:04:05,828
If they had spotted us,
we would've been shot at.

41
00:04:06,871 --> 00:04:07,956
Ten o'clock.

42
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:10,541
There was an unusual splashing
by the bushes.

43
00:04:10,625 --> 00:04:12,210
Maybe a fish or an alligator?

44
00:04:12,877 --> 00:04:15,171
They're coming. We should leave!

45
00:04:17,757 --> 00:04:21,427
Grab the leaves like this, master.

46
00:04:21,511 --> 00:04:24,681
I told you to be quiet, dimwit!

47
00:04:24,764 --> 00:04:29,143
No. I'm folding these leaves in half.

48
00:04:31,229 --> 00:04:34,983
Here, let's weave it and rest it here.

49
00:04:39,445 --> 00:04:40,780
Stick them here like this.

50
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:45,868
And now, let's paint your face.

51
00:04:51,582 --> 00:04:52,458
Excellent.

52
00:04:52,542 --> 00:04:55,753
Good, now let's get your face ready.

53
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:12,562
Emergency report!

54
00:05:12,645 --> 00:05:14,439
All guards,
return to the Disciplinary Wing!

55
00:05:14,522 --> 00:05:16,399
I repeat, everyone back to their posts!

56
00:05:16,983 --> 00:05:18,276
Turn back?

57
00:05:18,359 --> 00:05:21,529
I'm not sure what's happening,
but it sounds pretty serious.

58
00:05:21,612 --> 00:05:22,447
Let's head back.

59
00:05:30,496 --> 00:05:33,166
Where the hell did these guys come from?

60
00:05:35,752 --> 00:05:39,047
Damn! Turn the engine on, hurry up!

61
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:40,423
It won't start in time!

62
00:05:40,506 --> 00:05:42,884
We'll get shot before it gets going!

63
00:05:42,967 --> 00:05:46,596
You there! What have you done
at the Disciplinary Wing?

64
00:06:00,985 --> 00:06:03,321
Listen! Do not move!

65
00:06:03,905 --> 00:06:06,657
Put your hands on the floor! Stay down!

66
00:06:07,575 --> 00:06:10,578
I said don't move, bastard!

67
00:06:10,661 --> 00:06:12,622
Hit the ground, now!

68
00:06:15,583 --> 00:06:18,336
- Our boat!
- We can take their boat.

69
00:06:18,419 --> 00:06:19,879
And you're doing it for us.

70
00:06:30,348 --> 00:06:31,516
What just hit us?

71
00:06:33,643 --> 00:06:35,520
I'm taking this boat.

72
00:06:35,603 --> 00:06:38,981
I'm sure you don't mind. Don't get eaten
by alligators on your way back.

73
00:06:39,899 --> 00:06:41,359
Diver Drive!

74
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,989
Jolyne, are the plants
still growing inside you?

75
00:06:47,573 --> 00:06:51,577
Let's continue heading east.
The sun is still going down.

76
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:56,082
So mean, tossing me around
like I was a sack…

77
00:06:56,666 --> 00:06:57,625
Oh, well.

78
00:07:13,808 --> 00:07:17,854
Hey Jolyne, I'm sorry,
but can you stop whistling?

79
00:07:19,397 --> 00:07:22,900
We might hear the guards' boats again.

80
00:07:23,443 --> 00:07:24,861
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING, ANASTASIA?

81
00:07:26,195 --> 00:07:28,823
ANASTASIA! HEY, CAN YOU HEAR ME?

82
00:07:30,408 --> 00:07:31,742
I can't speak!

83
00:07:37,498 --> 00:07:40,376
ANASTASIA!
MY VOICE! IT'S NOT COMING OUT!

84
00:07:41,752 --> 00:07:42,587
ANASTASIA!

85
00:07:45,673 --> 00:07:46,716
This Stand…

86
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:51,012
He's here to do more than
just run off with the green child!

87
00:07:51,095 --> 00:07:53,181
He was slowly attacking us!

88
00:07:54,098 --> 00:07:55,641
What's the matter?

89
00:07:55,725 --> 00:07:57,977
You are breathing hard.

90
00:08:01,606 --> 00:08:02,982
I feel the same way, Jolyne.

91
00:08:03,774 --> 00:08:05,401
Can you feel my heart pounding?

92
00:08:05,485 --> 00:08:07,278
You are suddenly getting close to me.

93
00:08:07,361 --> 00:08:10,865
Do you finally understand
how I feel for you?

94
00:08:14,494 --> 00:08:16,913
Not my eyes, my tongue!

95
00:08:17,788 --> 00:08:19,874
Are you at a loss for words?

96
00:08:21,792 --> 00:08:24,086
I know how you feel.

97
00:08:24,670 --> 00:08:27,089
But there's no need for words between us.

98
00:08:27,173 --> 00:08:28,883
I feel the same about you.

99
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,594
You're dying to kiss me, right?

100
00:08:31,677 --> 00:08:35,556
You want a deep kiss already?

101
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:45,191
When, and how did he attack us?
I didn't notice at all.

102
00:08:45,274 --> 00:08:47,610
I have to keep him in my sights!

103
00:08:55,493 --> 00:08:56,369
Jolyne…

104
00:08:58,913 --> 00:08:59,997
Well, which is it?

105
00:09:00,081 --> 00:09:02,583
Do you want to kiss, or not?

106
00:09:03,084 --> 00:09:07,672
I know, is this a kink?

107
00:09:08,297 --> 00:09:10,800
Like, you are particular about
your kissing angle…

108
00:09:12,343 --> 00:09:14,637
An auto-tracking Stand.

109
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:19,100
It follows our orders like a slave
and acts docile like a servant.

110
00:09:19,183 --> 00:09:20,726
It pretends to be harmless.

111
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:23,604
But that's his method.

112
00:09:23,688 --> 00:09:26,315
It's a Stand that strikes

113
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:28,693
when its prey lets their guard down!

114
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,404
At this rate, we're both toast.

115
00:09:38,661 --> 00:09:40,204
Bring it on.

116
00:09:40,288 --> 00:09:41,581
Try to attack me.

117
00:09:42,164 --> 00:09:44,125
I must make Anastasia see
what's happening.

118
00:09:49,046 --> 00:09:51,007
YA-YA MA.

119
00:09:51,090 --> 00:09:53,593
That's my name.

120
00:09:53,676 --> 00:09:55,261
YA-YA MA.

121
00:09:55,344 --> 00:09:59,098
Let me show you how to tan frog hide.
Look here.

122
00:09:59,181 --> 00:10:04,937
Rub this mixture made of fat and brains
all creamy and thick

123
00:10:05,021 --> 00:10:08,149
on the back of the frog skin.

124
00:10:08,232 --> 00:10:11,569
This smoothes the hide.

125
00:10:12,153 --> 00:10:15,698
If you want, I can go get ten more

126
00:10:15,781 --> 00:10:20,411
and tailor up the coolest
super mini-skirt using their hide.

127
00:10:20,494 --> 00:10:25,791
It'll make your legs look ultra-long
and slim, and your hips will look wide!

128
00:10:26,375 --> 00:10:29,211
Jolyne, what is the matter? Seriously.

129
00:10:29,795 --> 00:10:32,298
If a trigger is necessary,

130
00:10:32,381 --> 00:10:35,134
there must be a trigger to his attacks!

131
00:10:35,217 --> 00:10:37,720
And if they're automatic, then…

132
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:52,276
This is what I was waiting for.

133
00:10:53,069 --> 00:10:56,405
I covered my skin with my threads
and waited for something to touch it.

134
00:10:56,989 --> 00:11:00,409
His attacks set off automatically
when we turn away.

135
00:11:00,493 --> 00:11:02,119
That's his ability.

136
00:11:02,203 --> 00:11:05,373
And now, I know how he attacks.

137
00:11:05,956 --> 00:11:06,874
He uses mosquitoes!

138
00:11:06,957 --> 00:11:09,543
Jolyne, what's going on?

139
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:15,174
Jolyne!

140
00:11:15,257 --> 00:11:17,760
Was I wrong? Does he not use mosquitoes?

141
00:11:17,843 --> 00:11:21,972
Or is he attacking in other ways too?

142
00:11:24,058 --> 00:11:27,061
BE ALL EYES
DON'T EVER LOOK AWAY

143
00:11:29,063 --> 00:11:30,231
You…

144
00:11:30,314 --> 00:11:32,233
Bastard!

145
00:11:32,316 --> 00:11:38,739
Master, you want me
to keep driving this boat?

146
00:11:38,823 --> 00:11:43,828
Or do you want to fight me one-on-one?

147
00:11:43,911 --> 00:11:44,954
Or will you escape--

148
00:11:49,917 --> 00:11:52,503
I was wrong. He doesn't use mosquitoes.

149
00:11:52,586 --> 00:11:55,005
He attacks in other ways.

150
00:11:55,089 --> 00:11:56,924
Yes, give me more!

151
00:12:00,344 --> 00:12:04,223
He attacks in a way that
can't be seen by the naked eye!

152
00:12:04,306 --> 00:12:05,224
Run!

153
00:12:05,307 --> 00:12:09,687
I do believe this is
your last chance to escape.

154
00:12:10,771 --> 00:12:12,481
I hope you are prepared.

155
00:12:13,357 --> 00:12:18,195
Prepared to regret ever being born
in this world.

156
00:12:23,284 --> 00:12:24,952
STAND NAME: DIVER DRIVE
STAND MASTER: NARCISO ANASTASIA

157
00:12:25,536 --> 00:12:28,789
Go to the back of the boat,
at the corner of the port!

158
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:37,256
Take out everything you're hiding.

159
00:12:37,339 --> 00:12:40,384
Spread them out by my feet.
Now, show them to me!

160
00:12:40,968 --> 00:12:45,055
Two rhino beetles,
a microphone for singing,

161
00:12:45,139 --> 00:12:49,518
low-calorie sugar packs, and three frogs.

162
00:12:49,602 --> 00:12:53,439
One raw frog hide, a bundle of broccoli,

163
00:12:53,522 --> 00:12:57,109
four mock strawberries,
and two used matchsticks.

164
00:12:58,569 --> 00:13:00,404
No, his belongings are irrelevant.

165
00:13:00,488 --> 00:13:05,367
We are upwind of him,
yet he is able to attack us.

166
00:13:06,243 --> 00:13:11,832
An auto-tracking Stand…
Your target is set, is that right?

167
00:13:11,916 --> 00:13:15,169
Yes sir, my target is absolutely locked on

168
00:13:15,252 --> 00:13:18,297
to Jolyne Cujoh since
the very first time I touched her.

169
00:13:19,256 --> 00:13:22,384
Your User commanded you to target her.

170
00:13:22,968 --> 00:13:26,680
You won't try to escape
until you've finished her off.

171
00:13:26,764 --> 00:13:28,474
YA-YA MA.

172
00:13:28,557 --> 00:13:31,894
And if you want to be by her side, master,

173
00:13:32,394 --> 00:13:36,232
I will finish you off along with Jolyne.

174
00:13:42,071 --> 00:13:43,989
Could he be using his spit to attack?

175
00:13:44,073 --> 00:13:45,658
YA-YA MA.

176
00:13:45,741 --> 00:13:47,910
You still don't get it, do you?

177
00:13:47,993 --> 00:13:52,456
You can't destroy or stop me, ever.

178
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:55,167
The only way to survive

179
00:13:55,251 --> 00:14:00,339
was to run away from me.

180
00:14:02,049 --> 00:14:04,802
This boat… Should I stop it?

181
00:14:05,427 --> 00:14:07,137
This splattering water…

182
00:14:07,721 --> 00:14:10,432
If the spit he uses to attack

183
00:14:10,516 --> 00:14:13,644
has already permeated
the wetland waters, then…

184
00:14:13,727 --> 00:14:16,855
Now, stand and go to the driver's seat.

185
00:14:16,939 --> 00:14:18,816
Crank up the speed.

186
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:21,235
Now get up.

187
00:14:21,318 --> 00:14:23,279
No, you'll make things worse.

188
00:14:24,613 --> 00:14:29,243
If you speed up the boat,
the water will splash everywhere.

189
00:14:31,203 --> 00:14:34,957
Yes, if that's what you want, master.

190
00:14:56,228 --> 00:14:57,062
Ribbit!

191
00:14:57,146 --> 00:15:03,694
Jolyne, he stopped attacking
although the boat's speed hadn't changed.

192
00:15:10,743 --> 00:15:12,494
YA-YA MA.

193
00:15:12,578 --> 00:15:14,663
Something's not right…

194
00:15:15,873 --> 00:15:18,834
Birds! Hide!

195
00:15:22,254 --> 00:15:24,131
Diver Drive.

196
00:15:24,214 --> 00:15:27,551
I don't care how he attacks.

197
00:15:28,177 --> 00:15:31,597
Since he is a perfect auto-tracking Stand,

198
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,682
I buried a frog in his head

199
00:15:33,766 --> 00:15:37,895
and connected its brain
to his tracking sensors.

200
00:15:38,479 --> 00:15:42,024
Try to track us as a frog
as long as you exist!

201
00:15:44,526 --> 00:15:48,364
Wait… what was I going to do?

202
00:15:48,447 --> 00:15:50,824
I am an auto-tracking Stand.

203
00:15:50,908 --> 00:15:56,288
My mission is to defeat Jolyne Cujoh
and return with the green child.

204
00:15:56,372 --> 00:15:57,331
Oh, dear.

205
00:15:57,414 --> 00:15:59,792
I have no time to be bumming around!

206
00:15:59,875 --> 00:16:03,087
I have to spatter my spit
to attack Anastasia!

207
00:16:03,170 --> 00:16:05,255
I'll create a static charge
by causing friction

208
00:16:05,339 --> 00:16:07,132
between the plastic and the propellers.

209
00:16:07,216 --> 00:16:10,844
That'll make my spit fly everywhere!

210
00:16:10,928 --> 00:16:14,556
He'll never figure it out!

211
00:16:15,432 --> 00:16:18,519
Oh, but those birds are so scary!

212
00:16:18,602 --> 00:16:20,187
Hide!

213
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:24,149
Ew, I peed myself like those frogs do!

214
00:16:25,275 --> 00:16:29,321
Woah, what a cutie! Look at those curves!

215
00:16:29,405 --> 00:16:32,282
Let me ride you, darling!

216
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:34,076
Oh, a rhino beetle!

217
00:16:36,954 --> 00:16:39,331
He won't bother us anymore.

218
00:16:39,415 --> 00:16:42,334
We need F.F.'s help to heal the wounds.

219
00:16:42,418 --> 00:16:43,836
All we need to do

220
00:16:43,919 --> 00:16:46,922
is wait for F.F. to finish D an' G off
and meet up with us.

221
00:16:51,677 --> 00:16:55,305
What the hell happened
to the Disciplinary Wing?

222
00:16:55,931 --> 00:16:58,350
Where are the guards and the prisoners?

223
00:16:58,434 --> 00:17:00,644
We've only been gone
for around ten minutes!

224
00:17:00,728 --> 00:17:03,564
Where did these plants even come from?

225
00:17:03,647 --> 00:17:05,607
How do we explain this?

226
00:17:05,691 --> 00:17:07,234
What is that prisoner's condition?

227
00:17:07,317 --> 00:17:08,902
Is he able to talk?

228
00:17:09,486 --> 00:17:14,158
Prisoner ME14067, D an' G.

229
00:17:14,241 --> 00:17:17,911
He is in critical condition.
His right arm almost got ripped off.

230
00:17:17,995 --> 00:17:19,246
We can't question him.

231
00:17:19,997 --> 00:17:26,587
I'll blow his head off for setting loose
a Stand that's creepy as hell.

232
00:17:37,806 --> 00:17:42,186
That man, isn't he
the prison's priest, Father Pucchi?

233
00:17:43,312 --> 00:17:45,481
What is a priest doing here?

234
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:48,859
Shit, forget about him for now.

235
00:17:48,942 --> 00:17:52,780
What's more important
is the definite death of D an' G.

236
00:17:54,782 --> 00:17:56,241
Three hundred fifty-nine.

237
00:17:56,325 --> 00:17:57,910
Three hundred sixty-seven.

238
00:17:57,993 --> 00:17:59,453
Three hundred seventy-three.

239
00:17:59,536 --> 00:18:00,996
Three hundred seventy-nine.

240
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:04,249
Three hundred eighty-three.
Three hundred eighty-nine.

241
00:18:04,333 --> 00:18:05,626
Three hundred ninety-seven.

242
00:18:05,709 --> 00:18:08,712
And now, the four hundreds.

243
00:18:08,796 --> 00:18:10,589
First, four hundred one.

244
00:18:10,672 --> 00:18:12,091
Then, four hundred nine.

245
00:18:12,174 --> 00:18:16,303
D an' G is gravely injured, meaning…

246
00:18:16,804 --> 00:18:21,058
I must conclude that
Jolyne Cujoh is still alive.

247
00:18:21,141 --> 00:18:25,479
And the plethora of withered plants…

248
00:18:25,562 --> 00:18:28,649
I take it that Dio's bone caused this.

249
00:18:28,732 --> 00:18:31,777
Dio's bone is using the prisoners' bodies

250
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:36,240
to accomplish something
outside of my imagination.

251
00:18:36,323 --> 00:18:37,491
Splendid.

252
00:18:37,574 --> 00:18:38,826
This is wonderful.

253
00:18:38,909 --> 00:18:41,578
So it has finally begun.

254
00:18:41,662 --> 00:18:45,457
I've been waiting for this moment
for 22 years.

255
00:18:45,541 --> 00:18:48,043
What D an' G witnessed here…

256
00:18:48,127 --> 00:18:51,171
I must ask him what he saw, in person!

257
00:18:52,464 --> 00:18:57,511
Isn't that right, Survivor's Guccio?
It seems you didn't see what happened,

258
00:18:57,594 --> 00:19:00,848
but the plants must have set
something in motion.

259
00:19:00,931 --> 00:19:03,559
Doesn't this call for a celebration?

260
00:19:03,642 --> 00:19:06,395
It will be in my hands soon.

261
00:19:06,478 --> 00:19:09,606
What is true happiness?

262
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:11,817
I will attain heaven.

263
00:19:12,693 --> 00:19:16,947
Sing praises. The thing that will be born
is heaven itself.

264
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:21,660
The curtains to the new world have risen.

265
00:19:33,797 --> 00:19:35,174
Splendid…

266
00:19:35,257 --> 00:19:37,676
Yes, praise this moment!

267
00:19:37,759 --> 00:19:42,097
Handel's "Messiah" is a true masterpiece!

268
00:19:46,143 --> 00:19:48,770
How befitting…

269
00:19:48,854 --> 00:19:51,023
It's as if the music exudes light.

270
00:19:51,565 --> 00:19:57,529
It is said that Handel led this piece
even the day before his own death!

271
00:19:59,698 --> 00:20:02,409
All right, leave D an' G to the medics.

272
00:20:02,492 --> 00:20:04,077
Question him after his treatment.

273
00:20:04,161 --> 00:20:08,582
We must search for
the other prisoners and guards.

274
00:20:08,665 --> 00:20:10,209
- Now, go.
- Yes, sir.

275
00:20:17,466 --> 00:20:21,637
No, I will question him
before he is treated.

276
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:26,391
I must not let
what was conceived get lost!

277
00:20:27,059 --> 00:20:28,810
Good. Now, start the car.

278
00:20:28,894 --> 00:20:29,770
Yes, sir.

279
00:20:38,570 --> 00:20:40,656
That woman…

280
00:20:40,739 --> 00:20:43,367
That face underneath the hat!

281
00:20:47,496 --> 00:20:48,455
You're done now.

282
00:20:48,538 --> 00:20:51,333
Those who control auto-tracking Stands

283
00:20:51,416 --> 00:20:54,044
are defenseless
when the tables turn on them.

284
00:20:54,127 --> 00:20:55,420
That's the risk you bear!

285
00:20:56,004 --> 00:20:57,381
It's F.F.!

286
00:20:57,464 --> 00:20:59,466
Why are they at this Disciplinary Wing?

287
00:20:59,549 --> 00:21:01,468
Since when? This is bad!

288
00:21:02,427 --> 00:21:04,012
They were after D an' G!

289
00:21:07,391 --> 00:21:08,558
He has a disc!

290
00:21:11,979 --> 00:21:13,647
Pale Snake is nearby!

291
00:21:14,398 --> 00:21:15,357
Where is he?

292
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:18,110
Where did he throw the disc from?

293
00:21:18,193 --> 00:21:20,404
Four hundred seventy-nine.

294
00:21:20,487 --> 00:21:22,322
Four hundred eighty-seven.

295
00:21:23,365 --> 00:21:25,117
Four hundred ninety-one.

296
00:21:25,701 --> 00:21:27,995
Four hundred ninety-nine.

297
00:21:28,078 --> 00:21:29,371
No way…

298
00:21:29,454 --> 00:21:30,622
The one who threw it was…

299
00:21:31,623 --> 00:21:32,749
It can't be him!

300
00:21:33,542 --> 00:21:36,336
This is bad. It's very bad for me.

301
00:21:37,337 --> 00:21:40,882
You are able to attack D an 'G
here and now

302
00:21:40,966 --> 00:21:46,388
because his Stand
YA-YA MA is tracking Jolyne.

303
00:21:46,471 --> 00:21:47,639
Pale Snake's User is…

304
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:49,850
This can't be!

305
00:21:50,475 --> 00:21:53,729
There are things I must learn from him.

306
00:21:53,812 --> 00:21:56,356
I cannot have him die yet.

307
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:58,775
So the one who controls Pale Snake is…

308
00:21:59,735 --> 00:22:02,029
If that's true, then what?

309
00:22:02,112 --> 00:22:04,114
Which do you prioritize?

310
00:22:04,197 --> 00:22:05,699
Is it me?

311
00:22:05,782 --> 00:22:09,494
Or is it finishing D an' G?

312
00:22:09,578 --> 00:22:11,038
You are…

313
00:22:11,121 --> 00:22:12,456
Father Pucchi.

314
00:22:13,290 --> 00:22:15,167
You bastard!

315
00:23:41,336 --> 00:23:46,341
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
